---
---
<section class="impact-quote-section section-padding">
  <div class="container mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 xl:px-0">
    <div class="quote-box relative flex flex-col border border-[rgba(0,217,255,0.4)] bg-[#02070D]/95 backdrop-blur-2xl rounded-[40px]">
      
      <!-- Dot Pattern SVG Background -->
      <svg
        aria-hidden="true"
        class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 h-full w-full fill-slate-500/30 md:fill-slate-500/40 rounded-[40px]"
      >
        <defs>
          <pattern
            id="dot_pattern_quote"
            width="24"
            height="24"
            patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"
            patternContentUnits="userSpaceOnUse"
            x="0"
            y="0"
          >
            <circle cx="3" cy="3" r="1.5" />
          </pattern>
        </defs>
        <rect width="100%" height="100%" stroke-width="0" fill="url(#dot_pattern_quote)" />
      </svg>

      <!-- 4 Solid Corner Squares -->
      <div class="absolute -left-1.5 -top-1.5 h-3 w-3 bg-[#00D9FF] z-30"></div>
      <div class="absolute -right-1.5 -top-1.5 h-3 w-3 bg-[#00D9FF] z-30"></div>
      <div class="absolute -left-1.5 -bottom-1.5 h-3 w-3 bg-[#00D9FF] z-30"></div>
      <div class="absolute -right-1.5 -bottom-1.5 h-3 w-3 bg-[#00D9FF] z-30"></div>

      <!-- Content -->
      <div class="quote-content relative z-20 w-full mx-auto max-w-6xl py-12 md:p-16 xl:py-24 xl:px-20">
        <p class="quote-badge text-xs md:text-sm lg:text-lg xl:text-2xl text-[#00D9FF] mb-8 font-medium tracking-wide text-left uppercase">
          A Filosofia Nutrição Avançada
        </p>
        
        <!-- Massive Typography (Sans-serif, Normal Case, High Contrast Weights) -->
        <div class="quote-massive text-3xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl xl:text-8xl tracking-tighter text-left">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 md:gap-3 lg:gap-4 items-baseline mb-2 md:mb-4">
            <h1 class="font-semibold text-white">"O consultório deve ser</h1>
            <p class="font-thin text-white">menos</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 md:gap-3 lg:gap-4 items-baseline mb-2 md:mb-4">
            <p class="font-thin text-white">calculadora</p>
            <h1 class="font-semibold text-white">e muito</h1>
            <p class="font-thin text-white">mais</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 md:gap-3 lg:gap-4 items-baseline mb-6 md:mb-12">
            <h1 class="font-semibold highlight-cyan">nutricionista..."</h1>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="quote-desc text-left text-neutral-400 text-sm md:text-lg lg:text-xl max-w-4xl leading-relaxed font-light">
          Chega de passar horas calculando dietas em casa no pós-consulta. O método Nutrição Avançada devolve o seu tempo livre, a sua segurança clínica e o verdadeiro brilho dos seus atendimentos.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .impact-quote-section {
    position: relative;
    padding-top: 80px;
    padding-bottom: 80px;
    background: var(--color-bg-primary);
    font-family: var(--font-main);
  }

  .quote-box {
    box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75), inset 0 1px 2px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  }

  /* Massive Typography */
  .quote-massive {
    font-family: var(--font-main);
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .font-semibold { 
    font-weight: 700; 
    margin: 0;
  }
  
  .font-thin { 
    font-weight: 200; 
    opacity: 0.9;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .highlight-cyan {
    color: var(--color-accent-cyan);
    text-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0, 217, 255, 0.4);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .quote-content {
      padding: 36px 28px;
    }
  }
</style>
